{
  "__comment": "Register on https://bigmodel.cn and put your key in ZHIPUAI_API_KEY. Optionally set 'base_url' to any OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions backend (e.g. Atlas Cloud: https://api.atlascloud.ai/v1) and use its key/model; leave 'base_url' empty to use Zhipu AI. Change default translate languages 'from' and 'to' you use",
